# Module 12 — schedule the drift loop so it runs while you sleep.
# Install in-container with:  crontab /lab/data/drift-loop.cron
# (A drift control you have to remember to run by hand is not a drift control.)
# Runs the full detect -> diff -> alert -> reconcile beat daily at 02:30,
# appending structured drift-event records to /lab/drift-events.log.
30 2 * * * /lab/data/drift-loop.sh loop >> /lab/drift-events.log 2>&1
